WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
No one dares to shoot the evil Jedi

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,480
Including those so-called super masters

3
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:05,560
For example, do you dare to go into the depths of the crater?

4
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:07,280
Mr. Fan wants to find a human body

5
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:08,520
It is recommended to act separately

6
00:00:08,520 --> 00:00:09,920
That way you can visit every corner

7
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:11,040
Boy, you're deaf

8
00:00:11,040 --> 00:00:11,960
I'll ask you again

9
00:00:11,960 --> 00:00:13,360
Leave the dangerous area to me

10
00:00:13,360 --> 00:00:14,880
You really don’t know how high the sky is and how high it is

11
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:15,880
It’s Xiangdao Yuechong

12
00:00:15,880 --> 00:00:17,400
Most familiar with Changbai Mountain terrain

13
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:19,000
Draw a detailed topographic map of it

14
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:20,480
Yes Mr. Fan

15
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:25,220
See clearly

16
00:00:25,220 --> 00:00:27,140
The people circled here are all Jedi

17
00:00:27,140 --> 00:00:29,140
There are three hidden craters alone

18
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:30,860
There are more than a dozen places in the Abyss

19
00:00:30,940 --> 00:00:32,500
If you fall, you won't be able to find any bones.

20
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:33,980
All villagers looking for a village will be there within ten days

21
00:00:33,980 --> 00:00:35,140
Meet back here

22
00:00:35,140 --> 00:00:36,580
You should also try to return within ten days

23
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:37,620
Because after ten days

24
00:00:37,620 --> 00:00:39,180
Even if I find a human body for three hundred years

25
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:40,660
It's too late to save people

26
00:00:40,660 --> 00:00:42,860
I will explore all decisions within ten days

27
00:00:42,860 --> 00:00:44,180
then come back

28
00:00:44,180 --> 00:00:45,660
I hope I can gain something.

29
00:00:45,660 --> 00:00:46,860
Explore within ten days
